- Zanzibar paper (USENIX ATC 2019): https://www.usenix.org/conference/atc19/presentation/pang
- SpiceDB (Zanzibar-inspired, open source): https://github.com/authzed/spicedb
- OpenFGA (Zanzibar-inspired): https://openfga.dev/
